Date: Tue, 15 Oct 2024 10:29:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 318/442] WIN2030-15704:feat:Add devfreq support

Changelogs:
   1.Enable the devfreq feature option in Linux, currently
supporting only the userspace governor..
   2.Add devfreq support to the DSP driver.

(cherry picked from commit 3f5440573559c5ea370a77628b7d6b6050781a58,
feature-pm branch)

Change-Id: Ia6962b76e69472a5b97801878b08721d45dfc797
Signed-off-by: huangyifeng <huangyifeng@eswincomputing.com>
